// SecondBrain/Inbox/meetings is 593 and SecondBrain/Knowledge is 334):
//   * no-op run, nothing new to embed ....... 33s   (was ~17s)
//   * one day of accumulated content ....... 278s   (232 chunks, ~1s/chunk)
